 PAY0001\n- **Invoice:** INV-50433 (due 2026-11-04)\n- **Amount:** $3,497.38\n- **Method:** Wire from the operating account\n- **Status:** Sent, and the invoice is marked paid\n\nBefore sending, I checked the operating account and it had no earlier payments. I also attached a unique ID to the wire so the system won't send it twice. The amount is under $10,000, so it didn't need the controller's approval.\n\nI didn't pay Acme Supplies's other two invoices. INV-57024 ($2,001.15) was already paid, and INV-88936 ($7,309.20) is still a draft waiting for approval.", "type": "text"}]}]}